              <li class="el_note">Manufacturer’s suggested retail price (tax included)</li>
              <li class="el_note">Actual product packaging in stores may differ.</li>
              <li class="el_note">EBIOS Tablets range in color from yellowish white to light yellowish brown and have the characteristic odor and taste of yeast.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="un_desc">
      <div class="ly_contInner">
        <div class="bl_descList">
          <section id="effects" class="bl_desc">
            <h2 class="bl_descTtl">Indications and Effects</h2>
            <div class="bl_descDetail">
              <ul class="el_bulletPointList">
                <li class="el_bulletPoint">Stomach heaviness, indigestion, and bloating of the stomach and abdomen</li>
                <li class="el_bulletPoint">Overeating, excessive drinking, heartburn, feeling of pressure in the chest, nausea (queasiness, nausea from a hangover or excessive drinking, feeling sick), vomiting</li>
                <li class="el_bulletPoint">Weak stomach, loss of appetite (reduced appetite)</li>
                <li class="el_bulletPoint">Nutritional supplementation, nutritional deficiency</li>
                <li class="el_bulletPoint">Nutritional supplementation for pregnant or postpartum women, nursing mothers, and people with a weak constitution</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </section>
          <section id="precautions" class="bl_desc">
            <h2 class="bl_descTtl">Precautions for Use</h2>
            <div class="bl_descDetail">
              <p class="bl_descTxt">The following persons should consult a physician, pharmacist, or registered OTC drug seller before taking this product.</p>
              <p class="bl_descTxt-em hp_indent">Persons receiving medical treatment from a physician.</p>
              <p class="bl_descTxt">In the following case, stop taking this product and consult a physician, pharmacist, or registered OTC drug seller, taking the outer box with you (or the pouch for pouch-type products).</p>
              <p class="bl_descTxt-em hp_indent">If symptoms do not improve after taking this product for about one month</p>
            </div>
          </section>
          <section id="dosage" class="bl_desc">
            <h2 class="bl_descTtl">Directions and Dosage</h2>
            <div class="bl_descDetail">
              <p class="bl_descTxt" id="table-desc">Take the following amount three times daily after meals with water or lukewarm water.</p>
              <div class="bl_descTable">
                <table class="bl_table" aria-describedby="table-desc">
                  <thead>
                    <tr>
                      <th>Age</th>
                      <th>Dose</th>
                    </tr>
                  </thead>
                  <tbody>
                    <tr>
                      <td>Age 15 or older</td>
                      <td>10 tablets per dose</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                      <td>Age 11 to under 15</td>
                      <td>8 tablets per dose</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                      <td>Age 7 to under 11</td>
                      <td>5 tablets per dose</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                      <td>Age 5 to under 7</td>
                      <td>3 tablets per dose</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                      <td>Children under 5</td>
                      <td>Do not take</td>
                    </tr>
                  </tbody>
                </table>
                <div class="bl_table_note">
                  <ul class="el_footnoteList">
                    <li class="el_footnote">Strictly follow the directions and dosage.</li>
                    <li class="el_footnote">When giving this product to a child, have the child take it under the guidance and supervision of a parent or guardian.</li>
                    <li class="el_footnote">Do not give this product to children under 5 years of age (to prevent the tablets from becoming lodged in the throat).</li>
                  </ul>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </section>
          <section id="ingredients" class="bl_desc">
            <h2 class="bl_descTtl">Ingredients</h2>
            <div class="bl_descDetail">
              <div class="bl_descTable">
                <table class="bl_table" aria-describedby="table-desc">
                  <thead>
                    <tr>
                      <th colspan="2">Ingredients per daily dose (30 tablets) for persons aged 15 or older</th>
                    </tr>
                  </thead>
                  <tbody>
                    <tr>
                      <td>Dried yeast</td>
                      <td>7,125 mg</td>
                    </tr>
                  </tbody>
                </table>
              </div>
              <p class="bl_descTxt">Contains lactose hydrate, calcium hydrogen phosphate, silicon dioxide, and hydrogenated oil as additives.</p>
              <div class="bl_desc_note">
                <ul class="el_noteList">
                  <li class="el_note">Because this product is yeast-derived, there may be slight variations in taste, color, and odor, but this does not affect its suitability for use.</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </section>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <section class="un_cases ly_section ly_section__beige-dark ly_section__before-beige">
      <div class="ly_contInner">
        <div class="ly_section_ttlBlock">
          <h2 class="ly_section_ttl">For These Situations and People<span class="ly_section_ttlIcon" aria-hidden="true"></span></h2>
          <p class="ly_section_lead">Do any of these apply to you?&nbsp;<br class="u-hidden-up-md">Support your digestive system with EBIOS Tablets</p>
        </div>
        <ul class="un_cases_imgList">
          <li class="un_cases_imgItem">
            <div class="un_cases_img hp_copyguard"><img src="/special/ebios/assets/img/product/cases_img_01.webp" alt="" width="390" height="390"></div>
            <p class="un_cases_imgItem_imgCaption">After a meal,<br>when your stomach feels heavy<br>or queasy</p>
          </li>
          <li class="un_cases_imgItem">
            <div class="un_cases_img hp_copyguard"><img src="/special/ebios/assets/img/product/cases_img_02.webp" alt="" width="390" height="390"></div>
            <p class="un_cases_imgItem_imgCaption">When you have<br>no appetite for<br>greasy foods</p>
          </li>
          <li class="un_cases_imgItem">
            <div class="un_cases_img hp_copyguard"><img src="/special/ebios/assets/img/product/cases_img_03.webp" alt="" width="390" height="390"></div>
            <p class="un_cases_imgItem_imgCaption">If you find you can no longer<br>eat or drink<br>as much as before</p>
          </li>
          <li class="un_cases_imgItem">
            <div class="un_cases_img hp_copyguard"><img src="/special/ebios/assets/img/product/cases_img_04.webp" alt="" width="390" height="390"></div>
            <p class="un_cases_imgItem_imgCaption">When you frequently attend<br>business functions or<br>social gatherings</p>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="un_feature ly_section ly_section__reverse ly_section__beige ly_section__before-beige-dark">
      <div class="ly_contInner">
        <div class="ly_section_ttlBlock">
          <h2 class="ly_section_ttl">Features of EBIOS Tablets<span class="ly_section_ttlIcon" aria-hidden="true"></span></h2>
          <p class="ly_section_lead">EBIOS Tablets are a designated quasi-drug made from dried yeast (purified and dried brewer’s yeast). The dried yeast in EBIOS Tablets contains 40 nutrients and helps soothe and revitalize a weakened digestive system affected by stomach heaviness, indigestion, and similar symptoms.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="un_featurePoint">
          <ul class="un_featurePoint_list">
            <li class="un_featurePoint_listItem">
              <hgroup class="un_featurePoint_listItem_headingGroup">
                <p class="un_featurePoint_listItem_number">Point.1</p>
                <h3 class="un_featurePoint_listItem_ttl">Helps Revitalize a Weakened Digestive System</h3>
              </hgroup>
              <p class="un_featurePoint_listItem_txt">EBIOS Tablets support a weakened stomach and are effective for symptoms caused by poor stomach function, such as indigestion and loss of appetite.</p>
            </li>
            <li class="un_featurePoint_listItem">
              <hgroup class="un_featurePoint_listItem_headingGroup">
                <p class="un_featurePoint_listItem_number">Point.2</p>
                <h3 class="un_featurePoint_listItem_ttl">Nutrients in EBIOS Tablets</h3>
              </hgroup>
              <p class="un_featurePoint_listItem_txt">The dried yeast in EBIOS Tablets contains vitamins B<sub>1</sub>, B<sub>2</sub>, and B<sub>6</sub>, protein, minerals, dietary fiber such as glucan and mannan, and other nutrients including nucleic acids.</p>
            </li>
            <li class="un_featurePoint_listItem">
              <hgroup class="un_featurePoint_listItem_headingGroup">
                <p class="un_featurePoint_listItem_number">Point.3</p>
                <h3 class="un_featurePoint_listItem_ttl">Essential Amino Acids the Body Needs</h3>
              </hgroup>
              <p class="un_featurePoint_listItem_txt">Of the amino acids that make up protein, the dried yeast in EBIOS Tablets contains all nine essential amino acids that the body cannot produce on its own.</p>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="ly_contInner ly_contInner__sm">
        <div class="un_featureIngredient">
          <div class="un_featureIngredient_block">
            <div class="bl_ingredients">
              <div class="bl_ingredients_circle">
                <div class="bl_ingredients_inner">
                  <p class="bl_ingredients_ttl"><span class="bl_ingredients_ttl_number">40</span><span class="bl_ingredients_ttl_txt-sm">Yeast-Derived<br>Nutrients</span></p>
                  <div class="bl_ingredients_core"><img src="/special/ebios/assets/img/common/info_ingredients_core_en.webp" alt="" width="609" height="606"></div>
                  <ul class="bl_ingredients_list">
                    <li class="bl_ingredients_item"><span class="bl_ingredients_triggerBtn"><span class="bl_ingredients_triggerBtn_txt"><span class="bl_ingredients_triggerBtn_txt-en">18 Amino Acids</span></span></span></li>
                    <li class="bl_ingredients_item"><span class="bl_ingredients_triggerBtn"><span class="bl_ingredients_triggerBtn_txt"><span class="bl_ingredients_triggerBtn_txt-en">9 Vitamins<sup>＊</sup></span></span></span></li>
                    <li class="bl_ingredients_item"><span class="bl_ingredients_triggerBtn"><span class="bl_ingredients_triggerBtn_txt"><span class="bl_ingredients_triggerBtn_txt-en">Dietary Fiber</span></span></span></li>
                    <li class="bl_ingredients_item"><span class="bl_ingredients_triggerBtn"><span class="bl_ingredients_triggerBtn_txt"><span class="bl_ingredients_triggerBtn_txt-en">3 Other Nutrients</span><br><span class="bl_ingredients_triggerBtn_txt-enSm">2 Nucleic Acids<br>Total Glutathione</span></span></span></li>
                    <li class="bl_ingredients_item"><span class="bl_ingredients_triggerBtn"><span class="bl_ingredients_triggerBtn_txt"><span class="bl_ingredients_triggerBtn_txt-en">9 Minerals</span></span></span></li>
                  </ul>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="bl_ingredients_note">
                <ul class="el_noteList">
                  <li class="el_note">Includes vitamin-related compounds</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <div class="ly_pageBottom ly_pageBottom__before-beige" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  </div>
</main>
